# Every text file is LF in every checkout, on every OS: the repo is LF-only
# (prettier enforces it in CI) and a CRLF checkout showed every touched file
# as a whole-file diff on Windows. Windows batch files are the one exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
backend/data/scanner/card-embeddings.bin filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
